{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44820","headline":"登楼望月寄凤翔李少尹 · 清江","name":"登楼望月寄凤翔李少尹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陌上凉风槐叶凋，夕阳秋露湿寒条。\n登楼望月楚山上，月到楼南山独遥。\n心送秦人趋凤阙，月随阳鴈极烟霄。\n轩车不重无名客，此地谁能访寂寥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"清江","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44820.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44820","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}